      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Vasukriti was born from a love for minimal jewellery that feels effortless, elegant, and easy to wear. It is a brand created for women who appreciate subtle beauty and jewellery that becomes a natural part of everyday life rather than something reserved only for special occasions.\n\nAt Vasukriti, we believe jewellery should feel comforting, lightweight, and timeless, something you reach for instinctively, day after day.",
        "order": 2,
        "design": {
          "style": "default",
          "alignment": "center",
