          "imageAlt": "Traditional jewelry crafting",
          "title": "Inspired by Everyday Grace",
          "text": "Each piece at Vasukriti is carefully curated from trusted vendors, selected for its design, quality, and everyday wear comfort.\n\nOur collections focus on anti-tarnish imitation jewellery that blends seamlessly into modern lifestyles, refined enough for special moments, yet simple enough for daily wear."
        },
