          "title": "Made for Everyday Moments",
          "text": "From morning routines to evening outings, Vasukriti jewellery is curated to move effortlessly with you through your day. Lightweight, elegant, and versatile, our pieces are designed to be worn often, loved deeply, and styled with ease."
